            "officialTitle": "A Multicenter, Single-Arm, Phase II (Simon Two-Stage) Study of Sacituzumab Tirumotecan (SKB264) Plus Glecirasib (KRAS G12C Inhibitor) as First-Line Treatment for KRAS G12C-Mutated Advanced NSCLC"
          },
          "statusModule": {
